<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>售前会前 Intelligence Brief</title></head><body><main>
<h1>售前会前 Intelligence Brief</h1>
<section><h2>1. Executive Brief</h2>{% if report.brief %}<p><strong>客户：</strong>{{ report.brief.customer_name }}<br><strong>调研目标：</strong>{{ report.brief.research_goal }}</p>{% endif %}<h3>一句话判断</h3><p>{{ composition.executive_judgment.text }}</p><h3>会前关键发现</h3>{% for item in composition.key_findings %}<article>{% if item.claim_ids %}<span data-claim-id="{{ item.claim_ids[0] }}"></span>{% endif %}<h4>{{ item.title }}</h4><p>{{ item.text }}</p><p><strong>售前意义：</strong>{{ item.presales_significance }}</p></article>{% else %}<p>未获得足以形成会前判断的公开事实。</p>{% endfor %}</section>
<section><h2>2. 面客前关键事实</h2><ul>{% for fact in facts.values() %}<li data-claim-id="{{ fact.claim_id }}">{{ fact.text }}<br><small>{{ trust(fact, report.sources).label }}；证据：{% for evidence_id in fact.evidence_ids %}<span data-evidence-id="{{ evidence_id }}">{{ evidence_id }}</span>{% if not loop.last %}、{% endif %}{% endfor %}</small></li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>
<section><h2>3. 售前机会假设</h2><p>以下均为机会假设，不代表客户已提出需求。</p><table><tr><th>公开信号</th><th>可能关联能力</th><th>会前待确认</th></tr>{% for item in composition.opportunity_hypotheses %}<tr>{% if item.claim_ids %}<td data-claim-id="{{ item.claim_ids[0] }}">{{ item.public_signal }}</td>{% else %}<td>{{ item.public_signal }}</td>{% endif %}<td>{{ item.related_capability }}</td><td>{{ item.validation_needed }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</table></section>
<section><h2>4. 首次交流建议问题</h2><ul>{% for item in composition.discovery_questions %}<li><strong>{{ item.category }}：</strong>{{ item.question }}<br><small>为什么问：{{ item.rationale }}</small></li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>
<section><h2>5. 当前判断边界与信息缺口</h2><h3>已确认公开事实</h3><ul>{% for fact in facts.values() %}<li data-claim-id="{{ fact.claim_id }}">{{ fact.text }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><h3>合理假设，但不可作为事实</h3><ul>{% for item in composition.opportunity_hypotheses %}<li>{{ item.text }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul><h3>尚未确认 / 建议交流验证</h3><ul>{% for item in composition.readable_gaps %}<li><strong>{{ item.title }}：</strong>{{ item.description }}<br><small>风险提示：{{ item.risk_note }}；建议询问：{{ item.suggested_question }}</small></li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>
<section><h2>Appendix A — Evidence Index</h2><p>注：来源陈述，待人工核实；历史信息不代表当前事实。</p><ol>{% for item in evidence %}<li data-evidence-id="{{ item.evidence_id }}"><p><strong>原文：</strong>{{ item.quote }}</p>{% set source = sources.get(item.source_id) %}{% if source %}<p>来源：<a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.title }}</a></p>{% endif %}</li>{% endfor %}</ol></section>
<section><h2>Appendix B — Sources Used</h2><table><tr><th>来源</th><th>网页</th><th>等级</th><th>日期</th></tr>{% for source in sources.values() %}<tr><td>{{ source.title }}</td><td><a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.url }}</a></td><td>{{ source.authority }}</td><td>{{ source.published_on or "日期未识别" }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</table></section>
<section><h2>Appendix C — Research Quality</h2><p>成功来源：{{ report.stats.sources_succeeded }}；失败来源：{{ report.stats.sources_failed }}；已批准事实：{{ report.stats.claims_approved }}。</p><p>编排模式：{{ report.composition_mode }}。内部失败与缺口记录保留在审计库。</p></section>
</main></body></html>
